00:07:27.096 --> 00:07:29.763
Yeah. And I think that,
that it's important.

00:07:29.763 --> 00:07:30.596
I love talking about it.

00:07:30.596 --> 00:07:31.514
I think, you know what people always say,

00:07:31.514 --> 00:07:33.178
and especially in the
South, they'll be like

00:07:33.178 --> 00:07:35.369
